    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Dish Without Salt",
      "",
      "One day, a wife asked her husband, “If one day I leave you and never come back, how would you feel?”",
      "",
      "The husband said, ”Well, that would be like if I was cooking and discovered that I was out of salt.”",
      "",
      "The wife was very happy, ..",
      ".. “You mean without me, it would be the same as a dish without salt. Your life would have no flavor, is that right?”",
      "",
      "The husband laughed and said, “No, no, no. That’s not what I mean.",
      "What I mean is, when I discover that I’m out of salt, I need to quickly go and buy a new bag of salt.”"
    ]
  }
